sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Client as Storefront or Backoffice
	participant Gateway as API Gateway
	participant Rating as Rating API
	participant Broker as Kafka Broker
	participant Catalog as Catalog API

	Client ->> Gateway: Synchronous feedback create or delete
	Gateway ->> Rating: Synchronous validated request
	Rating ->> Rating: Commit authoritative feedback
	Rating -->> Client: Synchronous write result
	Rating -->> Broker: Asynchronous feedback fact
	Broker -->> Catalog: Durable delivery

	alt Duplicate event
		Catalog ->> Catalog: Ignore through idempotency guard
	else Existing book
		Catalog ->> Catalog: Recalculate derived rating summary
	else Missing or deleted book
		Catalog -->> Broker: Asynchronous failed-projection fact
		Broker -->> Rating: Compensation delivery
		Rating ->> Rating: Delete invalid feedback
	else Temporary processing failure
		Catalog ->> Catalog: Retry, then dead-letter if exhausted
	end
